@segment  descend-f27-f10
@title    Return — Focus 27 down to Focus 10
@levels   F10
@fixed
@duration ~3m

say You'll now return from Focus 27, counting slowly back, down through each state in turn, all the way to Focus 10.
pause 6
say Twenty-seven.
pause 4
level F26
say Twenty-six.
pause 4
level F25
say Twenty-five.
pause 4
level F23
say Twenty-four.
pause 4
say Twenty-three.
pause 4
level F21
say Twenty-two.
pause 4
say Twenty-one.
pause 4
level F15
say Twenty.
pause 4
say Nineteen.
pause 4
say Eighteen.
pause 4
say Seventeen.
pause 4
say Sixteen.
pause 4
say Fifteen.
pause 4
level F12
say Fourteen. You're returning to time.
pause 4
say Thirteen. Calmly and comfortably.
pause 4
say Twelve.
pause 5
say You're now back in Focus 12, the state of expanded awareness.
pause 6
level F10
say Eleven.
pause 4
say Ten.
pause 5
say You're now in Focus 10.
pause 4
say Mind awake. Body asleep.
pause 6
